WEBVTT

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:33.590
Yu! Thank God you're alive!

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:37.260
Hey there.

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:42.570
You stupid Earl! Hurry up and untie us!

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:45.840
Hey, I didn't have to save you back there.

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:47.900
You're really something else, you know that?!

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:55.540
Dad... Mom...

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:56.650
No way!

00:00:58.150 --> 00:01:00.060
Today's a pretty weird day,

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:03.120
the way we suddenly acquired these two kids.

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:06.280
Yeah, it's been a weird day.

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:09.700
Professor Hayakawa!

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:13.170
What are you talking about?!
Don't you recognize me?!

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:18.470
It's me, Ai! Come on, Yu, say something!

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:19.800
Calm down, Ai!

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:24.540
They're probably being controlled through
some kind of hypnotism!

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:25.750
Probably...

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:28.920
What happened to the Comodeen?!

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:34.240
The submarine and everyone
met their fate at sea.

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:37.020
That's horrible!

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:40.090
<i>Everyone... Everyone...</i>

00:01:41.430 --> 00:01:42.330
<i>Everyone!</i>

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:16.160
I haven't killed you because
I'm going to have you help me out.

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:17.830
Isn't that right, Oscha?

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:20.170
That's right, Your Excellency.

00:02:20.170 --> 00:02:25.470
Except the cute one. She was brought because
I was thinking I would Hughug her later on.

00:02:28.780 --> 00:02:32.040
Patissier, we're counting on you.

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:34.010
As you wish.

00:02:34.950 --> 00:02:37.470
We'll go right ahead and start
using them as ingredients.

00:02:37.820 --> 00:02:40.520
We'll make the best tasting dessert ever.

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:43.390
We must test the fruits of our research.

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:47.490
The physics of Wonderland
are absolutely incredible.

00:02:48.760 --> 00:02:54.220
Well, it's been a great deal of work
raising Chaos thus far.

00:02:54.700 --> 00:03:00.470
But thanks to Lord Makenshi,
the time is finally right!

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:05.380
Switch on!

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:22.150
Clear!

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:23.360
Ai!

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:27.560
Clear is actually Omega's heart, you see.

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:29.100
Omega's heart?!

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:35.070
Of course even the great Omega darling is
powerless if he is closed in by that Flying Water.

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:39.110
Omega and the Flying Water
both repel each other.

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:41.950
By combining the two, their properties change.

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:45.080
This is firmly based on the definitions
of Wonderland physics.

00:03:45.590 --> 00:03:48.720
<i>After the scattered pieces of Omega
become one again,</i>

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:52.220
<i>he can once again go plague
the Outside World with Chaos.</i>

00:03:52.690 --> 00:03:55.130
That's what we had planned...

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:57.590
But Clear is the only one left.

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:03.610
But hey, Makenshi, as long as
we have this invention,

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:06.800
I will be able to merge with Clear myself.

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:09.200
Merge?

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:11.510
Well, just watch.

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:16.080
We will now begin processing the ingredients.

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:17.640
What are you going to do with Clear?!

00:04:25.390 --> 00:04:27.620
Stop it! Please!

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:30.500
Ai...

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:41.510
Clear!

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:06.160
You still had enough strength to do
something like that, Makenshi?

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:08.090
You really leave me no choice.

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:23.480
Be quiet.

00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:25.580
Good night.

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:34.360
White Cloud...

00:05:35.030 --> 00:05:38.060
That's enough, stop it! You shouldn't do this!

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:40.700
Oh, this feels great.

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:44.140
Whenever you fuss, it really fills up my stomach.

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:47.640
Our value systems are completely different.

00:05:48.210 --> 00:05:53.270
Mr. Kaze! Take them out with the Magun!

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:54.520
Kaze...

00:05:55.150 --> 00:05:56.170
Crux...

00:05:57.650 --> 00:06:00.620
Please feed that stuff to Chaos.

00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:08.760
Crux!

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:25.140
Now you can forget about calling any Summons.

00:06:26.010 --> 00:06:27.340
This is really bad now.

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:30.580
What in the world are you guys
planning on doing?!

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:37.020
All we're going to do is destroy and
consume the new Outside World.

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:40.190
To obtain the energy for Chaos...

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.930
New Outside World...

00:06:42.930 --> 00:06:44.920
Do you mean our world?

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:47.570
You are exactly right.

00:06:49.170 --> 00:06:51.740
Poshepocket! Anything is fine!

00:06:51.740 --> 00:06:54.940
Just give us something that will
take care of these guys!

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:11.350
My Hughug baby said that
was a disgusting snack.

00:07:13.900 --> 00:07:16.560
<i>You won't get away with this!
If I could only use my Kigen Arts...</i>

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:18.170
Stop it!

00:07:23.070 --> 00:07:24.940
Now I see.

00:07:25.370 --> 00:07:28.810
Oscha, you've known all along, haven't you?

00:07:28.810 --> 00:07:30.570
Of course, Your Excellency.

00:07:31.610 --> 00:07:35.150
Yu, we will unite with each other,

00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:37.620
together with your sister.

00:07:39.150 --> 00:07:44.920
You two are excellent ingredients
for feeding Chaos.

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:50.030
Yes! Good enough to force
Wonderland to evolve!

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:51.930
How...

00:07:51.930 --> 00:07:53.060
Us?

00:07:55.270 --> 00:07:59.670
We've been awaiting the day
when you would be old enough.

00:08:01.840 --> 00:08:04.740
<i>We lured you in with the Subway,</i>

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:08.480
<i>and continued to follow you
with the transmission device</i>

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:10.690
<i>that was attached to the Chocobo.</i>

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:13.850
<i>We tracked you like a farmer does
his grazing cattle.</i>

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:18.130
<i>We controlled your journey through
the use of different predicaments</i>

00:08:18.130 --> 00:08:20.750
<i>and raised you to be most excellent ingredients.</i>

00:08:23.400 --> 00:08:24.800
Why did you do that to us?!

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:27.130
You're lying!

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:31.410
He's right! We're normal kids.

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:32.670
No, you're not.

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:33.880
Stop it!

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:39.050
<i>You two were found in Wonderland
and taken to the Outside World.</i>

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:42.980
<i>You are totally different beings.</i>

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:48.820
We're not human?

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:53.090
We're not really Mom and Dad's kids either?

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:55.300
Is that why they're...

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:57.290
No! That's not true!

00:08:58.900 --> 00:09:01.300
Wait! Listen to me!

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:06.130
Don't waste your time.
The world already belongs to me!

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:21.410
Hey, are you sure this is the right way, kupo?

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:25.790
Look! That's it, I'm sure of it!

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:28.130
Mr. Kaze is in there!

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:36.400
The bond of love is an amazing thing!
Hold on, Mr. Kaze!

00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:38.800
I'll be sure to save you!

00:09:45.050 --> 00:09:47.670
Stop it! Please!

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:54.450
Transfer Omega's power to His Excellency!

00:09:55.220 --> 00:09:56.450
Professor Hayakawa!

00:09:58.190 --> 00:10:03.500
Please think back! Twelve years ago
when you lost your children!

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:07.230
Ai and Yu came into your lives and
your bond with them supported you!

00:10:10.470 --> 00:10:11.560
Do it!

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:28.620
<i>This feels great! It feels so good!
This feels so good!</i>

00:10:29.590 --> 00:10:31.060
Professor Hayakawa!

00:10:32.030 --> 00:10:34.830
My name is Lisa Pacifist!

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:38.560
I'm an agent that was dispatched
to search for you!

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:42.830
That's why I've been traveling with Ai and Yu!

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:48.840
Ai and Yu believed that their mom and dad
were performing research

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:52.210
so the world's people could be happy...

00:10:53.450 --> 00:10:56.440
They risked their own lives to
come search for you,

00:10:56.950 --> 00:10:58.350
and now you're going to kill them?!

00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:02.050
No!

00:11:06.730 --> 00:11:08.720
What are you doing?

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:13.330
Ai and Yu are our children.

00:11:13.670 --> 00:11:17.830
They might not be our blood,
but that doesn't matter.

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:20.900
Dad...

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:23.070
Mom...

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:36.720
How could my manipulative baby
have stopped working?!

00:11:36.720 --> 00:11:38.160
That is true love, kupo!

00:11:40.490 --> 00:11:41.600
Moogle!

00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:42.650
He's alive!

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:47.870
We'll show you the power of love, kupo!

00:12:07.890 --> 00:12:08.860
Dad!

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:10.020
Mom!

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:11.510
Ai! Yu!

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:13.650
We're sorry.

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:20.070
Thank you.

00:12:20.230 --> 00:12:22.330
I'm always happy to help out a woman, kupo.

00:12:23.370 --> 00:12:24.270
Lou!

00:12:25.310 --> 00:12:27.470
You can always depend on me!

00:12:27.840 --> 00:12:30.330
I'm so glad you're alive!

00:12:31.050 --> 00:12:33.070
Mr. Kaze! Are you all right?

00:12:33.550 --> 00:12:35.280
I'm going to Hughug you to death!

00:12:48.230 --> 00:12:49.530
Poshepocket!

00:12:49.530 --> 00:12:50.790
How mean!

00:12:51.170 --> 00:12:52.760
You're the mean one here!

00:12:57.840 --> 00:13:00.970
What a naughty girl!

00:13:03.140 --> 00:13:05.610
I can be pretty scary when I get mad.

00:13:13.620 --> 00:13:14.520
Lou!

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:26.430
Lou!

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:28.530
Lou!

00:13:32.710 --> 00:13:34.370
Ai... Yu...

00:13:35.510 --> 00:13:42.040
I'm glad you got to see your mom and dad.

00:13:43.350 --> 00:13:44.320
Lou!

00:13:46.820 --> 00:13:48.290
Mr. Kaze...

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:56.120
Mr. Kaze, am I in your gaze?

00:13:57.200 --> 00:14:02.260
You will always be in my gaze.

00:14:03.540 --> 00:14:04.700
Always...

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:07.010
Forever...

00:14:07.810 --> 00:14:09.440
And ever...

00:14:13.610 --> 00:14:14.580
It can't be...

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:15.670
No!

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:17.950
Lou!

00:14:17.950 --> 00:14:19.180
How could this be?
Lou!

00:14:21.690 --> 00:14:23.750
You guys are really being bad.

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:36.030
Now I'm going to have to eat you myself!

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:39.970
This looks bad. Run, kupo!

00:14:39.970 --> 00:14:41.270
It's useless!

00:14:48.520 --> 00:14:51.280
He's consuming our spirits!

00:14:52.090 --> 00:14:54.990
I've lost all of my energy, kupo.

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:57.650
Partner...

00:14:59.660 --> 00:15:02.300
Kaze! Kill the Earl!

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:04.260
Get revenge for Lou!

00:15:06.970 --> 00:15:09.490
Whoa! The Magun has been fixed, kupo!

00:15:09.940 --> 00:15:12.740
This is Ai and Yu's ability.

00:15:13.810 --> 00:15:14.740
It has moved.

00:15:17.110 --> 00:15:19.140
Soil is my power!

00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:47.930
The Magun has thawed!

00:15:55.450 --> 00:15:58.080
What do you think you're going
to do without bullets?!

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:02.220
<i>I didn't have any that one time either.</i>

00:16:02.990 --> 00:16:05.820
<i>I reached Chaos...</i>

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:07.850
<i>And then...</i>

00:16:24.410 --> 00:16:25.540
My thanks.

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:30.510
This is all over. You're finished!

00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:32.850
Kaze...

00:16:32.850 --> 00:16:33.910
Please...

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:35.820
Don't lose!

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:39.150
<i>Black Wind!</i>

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:47.270
The Mist of my soul...

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:48.860
I must play it!

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:51.300
Symphony of the White Cloud!

00:17:11.830 --> 00:17:12.720
Makenshi!

00:17:15.860 --> 00:17:21.320
What an idiot! How stupid of you,
to come just to be eaten!

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:33.050
What is this? He's become just like
Chaos from before.

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:35.850
<i>Black Wind...</i>

00:17:35.850 --> 00:17:37.550
You really think you can defeat me?

00:17:37.550 --> 00:17:38.650
<i>Quickly...</i>

00:17:38.650 --> 00:17:39.620
You're finished!

00:17:40.390 --> 00:17:42.990
<i>While I'm sealing Chaos,</i>

00:17:42.990 --> 00:17:44.690
I'll finish you!

00:17:44.690 --> 00:17:45.620
<i>Now!</i>

00:17:47.630 --> 00:17:48.750
<i>Mr. Kaze...</i>

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:54.270
<i>Use me...</i>

00:17:56.740 --> 00:17:57.670
<i>Aura...</i>

00:17:58.170 --> 00:18:02.610
<i>My Soil... Use my Soil!</i>

00:18:16.890 --> 00:18:17.950
Lou?

00:18:26.270 --> 00:18:30.200
I do not care how much blood must be shed,

00:18:30.840 --> 00:18:33.000
as long as it is used to destroy Chaos!

00:18:34.070 --> 00:18:37.240
The light that fills your eyes,
Tear Rainbow!

00:18:42.280 --> 00:18:45.220
All right, use my Soil!

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:48.850
Moogle!

00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:54.960
The ultimate spirit,
Soul Gunmetal!

00:18:57.930 --> 00:18:59.460
Crystallized lives...

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:01.190
And finally...

00:19:05.810 --> 00:19:08.930
The appropriate Soil to use against
you has been decided!

00:19:12.450 --> 00:19:13.380
Soil...

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:14.400
Kaze is...

00:19:19.120 --> 00:19:20.020
<i>Lisa...</i>

00:19:21.690 --> 00:19:23.280
<i>Fire me!</i>

00:19:26.090 --> 00:19:30.120
The helix of my life,
Endless White!

00:19:36.140 --> 00:19:39.040
<i>Transform my life into spiritual energy...</i>

00:19:44.980 --> 00:19:48.510
<i>Please! Don't erase life!</i>

00:20:32.060 --> 00:20:34.360
<i>Black Wind...</i>

00:20:35.230 --> 00:20:37.250
<i>White Cloud...</i>

00:20:38.570 --> 00:20:42.430
Unlimited...

00:20:54.680 --> 00:20:57.810
What do you suppose happened
to our travelers?

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:05.020
Someday, I will tell you, when we meet again.

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:13.860
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:13.860
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:21:15.800 --> 00:21:21.430
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:21:15.800 --> 00:21:21.430
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:21:23.580 --> 00:21:30.780
With our eyes on the future

00:21:23.580 --> 00:21:30.780
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:36.850
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:36.850
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:21:40.560 --> 00:21:47.830
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:21:40.560 --> 00:21:47.830
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:54.400
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:54.400
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:21:55.840 --> 00:21:59.750
Fly to the Neverland

00:21:55.840 --> 00:21:59.750
Fly to the Neverland

00:21:59.750 --> 00:22:09.590
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:21:59.750 --> 00:22:09.590
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete
